Official signed Windows x64 CPU binary selected by the user. Archive SHA-256: aaa1d04fcf86bd31e84b90bc0cbde80e632bd0720dcc5d8ba05c4fe45c09d127
Only onnxruntime.dll is used; no Azure, GPU or external execution provider is
registered or shipped. Telemetry is disabled on environment creation. Two shared
inference worker threads, no spinning. Microsoft CRT runtime dependencies are
redistributed from the matching installed Visual Studio redistributable with
signature and SHA-256 verification. This is not the reduced source build.
